  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2130_announce_01",
      "hash64": "987D2E7E8D48789B",
      "text": "Für unsere vier verbleibenden Teilnehmer wird es\\nnun Zeit für Runde 3!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2130_announce_02",
      "hash64": "987D2F7E8D487A4E",
      "text": "Champ [VAR 0x0100(0000)] gegen...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2130_announce_03",
      "hash64": "987D307E8D487C01",
      "text": "...Señora Amura, die Kampflehrerin!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2130_battle_01",
      "hash64": "3C3C43BF3B5E3C28",
      "text": "Tach, Neuzugang![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2130_battle_02",
      "hash64": "3C3C46BF3B5E4141",
      "text": "Das Große Akademieturnier... Oder besser\\ngesagt die Ultimative Schulschlacht.\\c\\nHier wird per Kampf entschieden, wer das\\nstärkste Mitglied unserer Akademie ist.\\c\\nSchon bei dem bloßen Gedanken daran juckt es\\nmich in den Fingern![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 161,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 230,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2130_battle_03",
      "hash64": "3C3C45BF3B5E3F8E",
      "text": "Das ist die ideale Bühne, um mein gesamtes\\nKönnen unter Beweis zu stellen![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2130_battle_04",
      "hash64": "3C3C48BF3B5E44A7",
      "text": "Und du bist also der Grund, weshalb wir heute\\ndieses Turnier veranstalten. Dafür danke ich dir,\\r\\nlieber Neuzugang![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2130_battle_05",
      "hash64": "3C3C47BF3B5E42F4",
      "text": "Wobei... Vielleicht sollte ich dich ab jetzt nur\\nnoch Champ [VAR 0x0100(0000)] nennen![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2130_battle_06",
      "hash64": "3C3C4ABF3B5E480D",
      "text": "Als Lehrerin empfinde ich es als meine Pflicht,\\nmeinen Schülern den Weg zum Erfolg zu weisen.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2130_battle_07",
      "hash64": "3C3C49BF3B5E465A",
      "text": "Aber andererseits darf ich als Kampflehrerin auf\\ngar keinen Fall gegen [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0E0D,0000)]einen Schülereine Schülerin verlieren.\\r\\nWie stehe ich denn sonst da?![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0E0D",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 148,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2130_battle_08",
      "hash64": "3C3C3CBF3B5E3043",
      "text": "Drum sei mir nicht böse, wenn ich dich im Kampf\\nnicht mit Samthandschuhen anfasse![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2130_announce_04",
      "hash64": "987D317E8D487DB4",
      "text": "Und [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0C0A,0000)]der Siegerdie Siegerin des dritten Kampfes ist...\\nChamp [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0C0A",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2130_battle_09",
      "hash64": "3C3C3BBF3B5E2E90",
      "text": "Diese Niederlage schmerzt besonders...\\nDa gibt es auch nichts zu beschönigen.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2130_battle_10",
      "hash64": "3C38BEBF3B5B2452",
      "text": "Doch ich kehre nicht mit leeren Händen nach\\nHause zurück. Ganz im Gegenteil! Ich habe\\r\\nunglaublich viel dazugelernt![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2130_battle_11",
      "hash64": "3C38BFBF3B5B2605",
      "text": "Es überrascht dich vielleicht, das zu hören,\\naber auch für uns Erwachsene gibt es täglich\\r\\nNeues zu lernen.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_2130_battle_12",
      "hash64": "3C38BCBF3B5B20EC",
      "text": "Sonst würden wir euch Kindern doch wohl kaum\\ndamit in den Ohren liegen, dass ihr euch hinter\\r\\neure Bücher klemmen sollt, nicht wahr?![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "common_2130_battle_13",
      "hash64": "3C38BDBF3B5B229F",
      "text": "Vielen Dank für den tollen Kampf! Hab den Sieg\\nfest im Blick und gib alles! Toi, toi, toi![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
